e, véritable lieu de vie à l’équilibre parfait entre nature et urbanité.","addr":"Allée de la Manufacture","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjJiODJjNzVkNDBlMTQ0ODdiNGU0Zjk4NWY2NmQ1NTkzODBjNzQ0NmEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJjZDRjYjg3MTVjYTQ4NmY5NDUxYmYwOWJhZmY2MDliNyJ9?signature=6dc347396b57bb146d9a4826dc7c81cf36187df29b1d82b64d29130018ab1332","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjU1NmRkMWQ0ZGVmZWEwN2M2NmIwNTkxYTQxODcxOTMyNWQwYjEzMDMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI5YTk5YjI2Y2ViZWE4MGY5ZGExM2Q5YWYzNDhjYjMzZSJ9?signature=e910734b91bc48832b3dcf4583a5f8631f406bff4294cec82a90f08e36c612b3","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjliNjMyZWE3YjU4NTdjMjE4NjU4ODA1ZTQ0ODlhNTE0YzUzNGZkNjQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI2NDY4Y2I4NWQxMjBiNmNhZWE1NzkzMGI2NjBlZjJlZiJ9?signature=9557316a5c575a669961d8b24a88d368d71da22747f876a7ed6ed84b15782506","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjRiZGU5YTU2ZjdmZjY1ZGEzYmMwZTA0N2JmOGZmMjAwMmJhYmY4YmEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJlNDVlM2FlMjA1OTFlODJhNGVhZWI4MTQzYjc0YjMwYSJ9?signature=26cf00cab85d426ef91e5c6355cb5e4647063438a443f211b99c68c6b14afa5f"],"yt":["https://youtu.be/x7hbzeUTKUE?si=sRRWyBQb0U67QSfM"],"vr":["https://www.visiolab.fr/Axo/Sporting/VillenaveOrnon/AltaVerde/","https://www.sporting-promotion.fr/panorama/alta-verde-domaine-de-geneste/"],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InNwb3J0aW5nIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo4NSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo4NSwiZml0IjoiY292ZXIifX0sIm